<title>UK: John Lewis weekly UK store sales up 17.3% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>John Lewis weekly UK store sales up 17.3% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership said on Friday its UK department store sales for the week to October 5 were up 17.3 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>For the 10 weeks to October 5, department store sales were up 16.4 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>Total sales, including those from the Waitrose supermarket chain, rose 12.6 percent year-on-year. For the 10-week period, sales were up 12.8 percent.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
